      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GIVE ME JOY (1) led and bolted in over 1280m here last time out in the first run for the stable. She bolted in there and ran quick time in the process, making her an attractive proposition with that run under her belt. She can set the tempo again from a better draw today and bring up back-to-back wins. ZOU ROYAL (5) tackled a stronger race last start at Canterbury over 1100m, closing strongly from the back. She was strong from the front prior to that and an inside draw today may see her up on the speed once more. Brings good form here and appears the main danger. MUST BE SAIN (2) sat off the speed and landed the knockout blow here last time out, scoring by 1.4L. Brodie Loy sticks and he can repeat the dose without surprising. SPICE ALLEY (4) is looking for the hat-trick and has to be included with a favourable set-up.",
